---
// Hero.astro
---

<section
    class="relative py-20 md:py-32 lg:py-40 flex flex-col items-center text-center px-4 overflow-hidden"
>
    <!-- Background Glow -->
    <div
        class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full h-[500px] bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50/80 to-transparent -z-10 blur-3xl rounded-[50%] pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl space-y-8 relative z-10 animate-fade-in-up">
        <!-- Badge -->
        <div
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-sm font-medium mb-4 shadow-sm"
        >
            <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
                <span
                    class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-blue-400 opacity-75"
                ></span>
                <span
                    class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-blue-500"
                ></span>
            </span>
            Disponible para nuevos proyectos
        </div>

        <h1
            class="text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight"
        >
            ¿Quiere que le lleguen <br />
            <span
                class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-green-600 to-emerald-500"
                >más mensajes</span
            > de clientes?
        </h1>

        <p
            class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed"
        >
            Tenga una web profesional sin complicaciones.
            <span class="hidden md:inline">
                sus clientes ven la información y le escriben directo al
                WhatsApp.</span
            >
        </p>

        <div
            class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center pt-8 items-center"
        >
            <a
                href="https://wa.me/50684291847?text=Hola%20Luis,%20quiero%20contratar%20una%20p%C3%A1gina%20web%20para%20mi%20negocio"
                target="_blank"
                class="group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-semibold py-4 px-8 rounded-full text-lg transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/20 ring-4 ring-transparent hover:ring-slate-900/10"
            >
                <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    class="w-6 h-6 text-green-400"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                >
                    <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path>
                    <path d="M3 21l1.65 -3.8a9 9 0 1 1 3.4 2.9l-5.05 .9"></path>
                    <path
                        d="M9 10a.5 .5 0 0 0 1 0v-1a.5 .5 0 0 0 -1 0v1a5 5 0 0 0 5 5h1a.5 .5 0 0 0 0 -1h-1a.5 .5 0 0 0 0 1"
                    ></path>
                </svg>
                <span>Quiero mi página</span>
                <svg
                    class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    ><path
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                        stroke-width="2"
                        d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg
                >
            </a>

            <a
                href="#ejemplos"
                class="text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 font-medium px-6 py-4 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group"
            >
                Ver ejemplos
                <span
                    class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-400 group-hover:bg-slate-900 transition-colors"
                ></span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div
            class="pt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-6 text-sm text-slate-500"
        >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg
                    class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    ><path
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                        stroke-width="2"
                        d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
                >
                Sin contratos raros
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg
                    class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    ><path
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                        stroke-width="2"
                        d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg
                >
                Respuesta rápida
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    @keyframes fade-in-up {
        from {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(20px);
        }
        to {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
    }
    .animate-fade-in-up {
        animation: fade-in-up 0.8s ease-out forwards;
    }
</style>
